## Interface: 16001, 16002, 16003, 16100, 16101, 16200
## Title: Improved Forever: Fishing
## Notes: Fishing from the controller: a pole in hand, R2 twice (or a double right-click) starts fishing, Circle or Esc stops; R2 casts Fishing, R2 twice puts your best lure on the pole; each cast as a scene of its own, the HUD stepping back and the camera coming in.
